cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Benchmark Design Determines Whether Attention Is Faithful"
abstract: >-
  Code, data and results for a 2x2 controlled study of how benchmark construction
  (negative sampling and positive-window placement) determines whether attention
  weights faithfully localize the experimentally characterized PUM2 binding motif
  in RNA-binding protein binding-site models.
type: software
